OL,3,GNEWSASea cadets unit closure fear over
OL,4,A#50k repair bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sea cadets unit says its future is
OL,7,Funder threat after being told it needs
OL,8,Fmore than #50,000 to repair its
OL,9,Fheadquarter's roof.
OL,11,FVolunteers at the Wallsend site, in
OL,12,FNorth Tyneside, said they feared they
OL,13,Fcould be forced to close if the money
OL,14,Fcannot be found, putting an end to
OL,15,Factivities for young people.
OL,17,FThe organisation has supported
OL,18,Fyoungsters in the town for more than 80
OL,19,Fyears, offering activities including
OL,20,Fseamanship, first aid and marine
OL,21,Fengineering.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
