OL,3,GNEWSASea cadets unit closure fear over
OL,4,A#50k repair bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficer in charge Michelle Robson said:
OL,7,F"If we don't get the roof fixed, it
OL,8,Fmeans that we could potentially have to
OL,9,Fclose, which means that cadets in the
OL,10,Ffuture would not get the opportunities
OL,11,Fwe've got going on right now."
